{"id":"469391","name":"蛋白丝瓜枸杞汤","author":"木紫冰","authorId":"11508024","desc":"","cover":"images/469391/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"1条"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"15颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"6g"},{"name":"麻油","amount":"6g"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"20g"},{"name":"水","amount":"600g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"丝瓜去皮，洗干净切段。","img":"images/469391/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切段的丝瓜，切条。","img":"images/469391/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"吧丝瓜条，放入碗中备用。","img":"images/469391/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋黄，蛋清分离，只用蛋清。","img":"images/469391/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蛋清，用筷子，搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/469391/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"淀粉加80克水，搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/469391/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中加入520克水，大火烧煮。","img":"images/469391/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开后，倒入丝瓜。","img":"images/469391/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"滚开后，放入盐，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/469391/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"关小火，倒入鸡蛋白。","img":"images/469391/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"用铲子快速的搅拌，至鸡蛋白凝固。","img":"images/469391/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蛋白凝固定型后，放入枸杞，小火煮2分钟。","img":"images/469391/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把淀粉水，再次搅拌均匀后，倒入锅中。","img":"images/469391/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"用铲子，不停的搅拌，至汤汁浓稠，关火。","img":"images/469391/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"把汤盛入碗中，滴入麻油。","img":"images/469391/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"搅拌均匀，即可上桌。","img":"images/469391/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}